\ A three-deep chain ending in a raising generic native, with no call in tail position, so
\ every frame renders.
\
\ The interpreter, eager, and AOT runs of this program must render the chain frame for frame
\ identically; the integration and AOT twins share this source verbatim.

inner: ( a b -- c ) [ + 0 + ] ;
outer: ( a b -- c ) [ inner 0 + ] ;

1 "x" outer .
